---
title: Basic Lentil Pasta Sauce
author: Jonathan Simmonds
servings: 8
yields: 8 x 320%g
cook time: 45 minutes
---

Fry @onion{3}(diced), @carrot{3}(diced), and @pepper{1}(diced) in a #pot{}.

Add @lentils{320%g}, @chopped tomatoes{2%400g cans}, @passata{1%400g can}, @?cayenne{}, @thyme{}, @garlic{1}(minced), @nutmeg{}, @olives{}, @red wine{100%ml}, and @water{200%ml}.

Boil for ~{45%minutes} until the lentils disappear.
